from the transcript.

00:03:05.150 --> 00:03:09.099
Even within the paragraphs there are ellipses
which are suspicious.

00:03:09.099 --> 00:03:12.739
The white house has claimed nothing substantive
has been removed there.

00:03:12.739 --> 00:03:13.739
Do we believe it?

00:03:13.739 --> 00:03:16.540
Why would we, they lie all the damn time.

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:19.370
So I don't know the full scope of what's in
that transcript.

00:03:19.370 --> 00:03:24.569
I remember Trump thinks the transcript vindicates
him.

00:03:24.569 --> 00:03:29.540
It only is about a third at most of the call
and it's incriminating.

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:35.450
So just imagine if they calculated this might
help them or might not damage them.

00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:38.260
Just imagine what the full transcript would
do.

00:03:38.260 --> 00:03:39.860
I'm glad you're thinking about it, Denise.

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:44.129
I don't know what else we can do to try and
get that full transcript, but all we can do,

00:03:44.129 --> 00:03:46.920
