00:03:50.579 --> 00:03:52.959
What they released is not a transcript.

00:03:52.959 --> 00:03:54.769
Don't allow Trump to keep calling it that.

00:03:54.769 --> 00:03:55.769
That's all we can do.

00:03:55.769 --> 00:04:01.129
And maybe someday, even if it's a as evidence
